or","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L75-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogExpAdjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogExpAdjoint","kind":"structure","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L72-L83","doc":"**Adjoint pair**: log_q ⊣ e_q as an inverse pair between\nprimitives and grouplikes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.flow_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.flow_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L70-L70","doc":"Flow equation: D_q e_q = e_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.counit_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.counit_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Counit: ε(e_q) = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.grouplike","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.grouplike","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Grouplike axiom: Δ_q(e_q) = (e_q, e_q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.D_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.D_q","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L64-L64","doc":"q-Jackson derivative on H. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.counit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.counit","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Counit on e_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.coprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.coprod","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Coproduct on e_q: Δ_q(e_q) = e_q ⊗ e_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.e_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.e_q","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The grouplike element e_q ∈ H. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential.mk","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QExponential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QExponential","kind":"structure","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L48-L70","doc":"**q-Exponential data**: an abstract grouplike of the q-shuffle\nHopf algebra, characterised by the flow equation `D_q g = g`.\n\nMirrors `QExponential` in `q-exponential.lean`; inlined here so\nthis block's sibling compiles standalone (the adjoint-pair\nstructure below needs the q-exponential fields `D_q` and `e_q`\nin scope). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-exponential","label":"def:q-exponential","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-exponential.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.counit_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.counit_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Counit: ε(log_q) = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.primitive_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.primitive_right","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.primitive_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.primitive_left","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L43-L43","doc":"Primitive axiom: Δ_q(log_q) = log_q ⊗ 1 + 1 ⊗ log_q.  In pair\nform: coprod log_q = (log_q, one).extend (one, log_q) additively.\nEncoded as a single equality on a symmetric tensor slot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.one","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Unit element of H. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.counit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.counit","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Counit on log_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.coprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.coprod","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Coproduct on log_q: Δ_q(log_q) = log_q ⊗ 1 + 1 ⊗ log_q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.log_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.log_q","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The primitive element log_q ∈ H. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QLogarithm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QLogarithm","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L28-L46","doc":"**q-Logarithm data**: a primitive element of the q-shuffle Hopf\nalgebra, inverse to the q-exponential grouplike. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-logarithm","label":"def:q-logarithm","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-logarithm.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0}]}